> Sometimes it is the things you see every day which inspire you. A colour or texture[ catches your] eye,[ and] you['re] hooked. The itch[ starts],[ and] you find you have to paint it. Whatever it might be. This happened for me a couple of years ago, when I was working with the lovely Vital Veg at Midmar. Every week I packed beautiful, colourful veg into veg bags for customers. Some of the ve[g] came home with me. And some of that came with me to the weekly art class I was attending.
